  "description": "SECURITY RESEARCH PLACEHOLDER - NOT A KEEPER SECURITY PRODUCT. This package ID is named by an install command in Keeper Secrets Manager documentation at docs.keeper.io, but was never published, which left it claimable by any third party because the Keeper.* ID prefix is unreserved on NuGet. This placeholder contains no assembly, no build targets and no code of any kind; it holds the ID so that it cannot be claimed maliciously while the issue is remediated. Published by independent security researcher gh0stfqce as part of a coordinated disclosure to Keeper Security via Bugcrowd. Keeper Security may request transfer, unlisting or deletion at any time and it will be actioned immediately.",
